extrema desde el primer d\u00eda. Sigue a Xploit ZERO en redes sociales y ay\u00fadanos a llevar la innovaci\u00f3n a\u00fan m\u00e1s lejos.", "short_description": "Xploit ZERO es el juego de acci\u00f3n y estrategia en Realidad Mixta que convierte tu habitaci\u00f3n en un campo de batalla. Piensa r\u00e1pido, construye tus defensas y reacciona en tiempo real para repeler a los invasores en partidas cortas, intensas y llenas de diversi\u00f3n. \u00bfTe atreves?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Xploit_zero_360.2.png", "id": "26529534970073330", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595136811_26529534980073329_7286307846810146766_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sV5-1n7s5Z8Q7kNvwGYK2Kc&_nc_oc=AdrI3GSx4YcfFRZxwwaYVlGX8By6FTnRnI3o24irBHQJpvUZTDr1Y0n26e6HQim3hf0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKKfvzAmytlV2J2e9kg9zmPfbOTzjFJG_p9_iqzZYswLQ&oe=6AA027D6"}, {"file_name": "Shot2.png", "id": "26394552166891673", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_26394552180225005_6856735165680477736_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DgKXekZDn1oQ7kNvwHEVM8R&_nc_oc=Adp5Yf6TgNUmGI2zMevtNgyr3VKYSHTRQw1kfWMbg2nuCQ_FcZWgsH-utGvU-7fVaCk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ7_xXtqRfurxbbXKz25UyynkQ_IAw4f1RXS46Zu4SxMw&oe=6A9FF6E2"}, {"file_name": "Shot5.png", "id": "3160157457501506", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_3160157460834839_8317283677516400765_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h7OUkROy5TkQ7kNvwHuT4gM&_nc_oc=AdrJ8J0yU03E3Fi90aQBjP7O891Mo2-6Maqmac56z-UArIdaRB8OaU3QmaLPUvN4Z6M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ98cG-tAlNwUnwsoLGxGGTu5KEhudB07_MhLdEMnNjSA&oe=6A9FFED9"}, {"file_name": "Shot3.png", "id": "2659403194432547", "image_type":